    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1709" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">albĭcēris</span></b> , e,
		or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">albĭcērus</span></b> ,
			a, um, also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">albĭcērātus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		albuscera, prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>wax-white</i>, i. e. <i>light
			yellow</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olea albiceris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 6</span></i>
			, and <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 24</span></i>: olea albicera,
			Cat. ap. <i><span class="en">Plin. 15, 5, 6, § 20</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">albicerata ficus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 18 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			; cf. Col 10, 417.</div>
